#
# The languages this project has a translation for, one code per line, as
# gettext's own build machinery expects. A language listed here must have a
# `<code>.po` beside this file.
#
# Empty on purpose: there are no translations yet. That is not the same as
# translation being unsupported — the modules bind the `evolution-jmap` domain
# at their entry points and Camel already looks the provider's name and
# description up in it, so a `.po` added here starts being used as soon as a
# catalogue is installed. Until then every lookup falls back to the English
# msgid, which is gettext's normal behaviour and not a failure.
